      "description": "To provide trusted land registration, valuation and surveying services that benefit Irish society and the economy. We are an independent Government agency under the aegis of the Department of Housing, Local Government and Heritage. Tailte Éireann was formally established under the Tailte Éireann Act in December 2022. "
