      "organizationClassification": "agency",
      "description": "Met Éireann is Ireland's National Meteorological Service and a line division of the Department of Housing, Local Government and Heritage. Our mission is to monitor, analyse and predict Ireland’s weather and climate, and to provide a range of high quality meteorological and related information to our customers."
